/**
 * 300 Personal Affirmations & Prayers for Gracy's Biblical Echoes YouTube Descriptions
 * Format: 2-3 sentences max containing personal prayer, affirmation, oath, resolution, or confession.
 * Covers all Canonical Praises #1 through #300.
 */
export const PERSONAL_AFFIRMATIONS_300: Record<number, string> = {
  1: "Heavenly Father, I confess that I am no longer a slave to fear, but Your beloved child welcomed through the Spirit of adoption. Today, I rest in the unfailing security of Your embrace and boldly cry out, 'Abba, Father!' I resolve to live this day in complete confidence and childlike trust in Your loving care.",
  2: "Lord Jesus, You are my great and eternal High Priest who understands every weakness I carry. I approach the throne of grace with holy boldness, receiving mercy and finding timely help for my present need. I make this confession of faith, holding firmly to my hope without wavering.",
  3: "All-Sufficient God, I bow before Your sovereign majesty, knowing You possess limitless power and absolute abundance. I lay down every anxiety, admitting that You are more than enough to supply all my needs and sustain my heart. I resolve to walk before You blameless, trusting Your mighty hand in every circumstance.",
  4: "Almighty Lord, nothing is impossible or too hard for Your sovereign power. When doubts arise, I stand firm on Your promise, declaring that You are able to do exceedingly abundantly above all I ask or think. I place my trust solely in Your unstoppable power to overcome every obstacle before me.",
  5: "Most High God, Possessor of heaven and earth, I exalt You above every name, power, and situation in my life. I confess that You alone are my shield and exceeding great reward. I dedicate my decisions, words, and actions today to honor Your supreme authority over my life.",
  6: "Living God, You are the God who sees me in my deepest valley and remembers me in secret. Even when I feel overlooked by the world, I take comfort knowing Your watchful eye is upon me and You hear my unspoken prayers. I resolve to walk in the quiet assurance of Your loving gaze today.",
  7: "Everlasting God, You never faint, grow weary, or abandon Your children across all generations. When my human strength is exhausted, I wait upon You to renew my spirit and mount up with wings like eagles. I declare that You are my everlasting portion and strength forever.",
  8: "Lord God of hosts, there is none as mighty as You, surrounded by faithfulness on every side. I admit my own weakness and welcome Your mighty arm to fight my battles and establish peace. I resolve to praise You in the midst of trials, knowing Your faithfulness never fails.",
  9: "Lord of Peace, You speak stillness over every raging storm in my heart and mind. I surrender my worries into Your hands, receiving the supernatural peace of God that surpasses all human understanding. I resolve to let the peace of Christ rule in my heart today.",
  10: "Hovering Holy Spirit, as You moved over the face of the waters to bring divine order and light out of chaos, move over my life today. Dispel every darkness, confusion, and void in my circumstances with Your creative peace. I yield to Your gentle hovering and declare that new life is breaking forth in my heart.",
  11: "Lord of Salvation, You have become my strength, my song, and my eternal rescue. I confess that my hope does not rest in earthly power, but in the saving grace of Jesus Christ. With joy, I will draw living water from the wells of Your salvation today.",
  12: "Lord my Healer, You are the Great Physician who heals all my diseases and restores my soul. I bring my body, mind, and spirit under the healing virtue of Your Word and covenant promise. I resolve to trust Your restorative power and walk in divine health and vitality.",
  13: "Sovereign Father, every good and perfect gift in my life comes down from Your generous hand of light. I confess my deep gratitude for Your daily provisions, blessings, and unmerited favor. I resolve to be a faithful steward and generous giver, reflecting Your bountiful heart to others.",
  14: "Merciful God, You are gracious and full of compassion, slow to anger and abounding in steadfast love. I admit my shortcomings and gladly receive the cleansing flow of Your tender mercy. I resolve to extend that same grace, forgiveness, and kindness to everyone I meet today.",
  15: "Father of Mercies and God of all comfort, You console me in every trouble so that I may comfort others. When sorrow or grief weighs heavy, I find sweet refuge in the warmth of Your divine presence. I resolve to be a vessel of Your compassion and healing to those who are hurting.",
  16: "God of All Grace, You called me to eternal glory in Christ and will Yourself perfect, establish, and strengthen me. I confess that Your grace is completely sufficient for every trial and temptation I face. I resolve to stand fast in this true grace, giving You all praise for my spiritual growth.",
  17: "Lord Jesus, You are the Way, the Truth, and the Life, my only bridge of reconciliation to the Father. I renounce every false path and align my steps with Your truth and holy guidance. I resolve to follow You faithfully each day, knowing You lead me into eternal life.",
  18: "Holy Spirit, Spirit of Truth, You dwell within me and guide my heart into all divine truth. I quiet the noisy distractions of the world to hear Your gentle still small voice directing my path. I resolve to heed Your convicting truth and walk in absolute honesty and purity.",
  19: "Precious Holy Spirit, my divine Comforter, Counselor, and Helper, You abide with me forever. When I feel lonely or overwhelmed, I welcome Your gentle peace and empowering presence into my heart. I resolve to walk in step with You, relying completely on Your supernatural guidance.",
  20: "Good Shepherd, You tenderly care for my soul, lead me beside still waters, and restore my inner strength. Because You are my Shepherd, I declare that I shall not want for any good thing today. I resolve to listen obediently to Your voice and follow where You lead.",
  21: "Faithful God, You are the true covenant keeper who never breaks a promise or forgets Your people. I anchor my soul to Your steadfast promises, knowing that what You have spoken, You will surely perform. I resolve to remain steadfast in faith, unswayed by changing circumstances.",
  22: "Unchanging Lord, You are the same yesterday, today, and forever, with no shadow of turning. In this shifting world, I find unshakeable stability in Your changeless character and eternal Word. I confess my trust in Your timeless love that will never abandon me.",
  23: "Living God, You are the true and eternal God whose kingdom shall never be shaken or destroyed. I turn away from all dead idols and fleeting worldly pleasures to serve the one true Lord. I resolve to honor You with a vibrant, burning devotion all the days of my life.",
  24: "Lord of Hosts, Commander of heaven's armies, You encamp around those who fear You and deliver them. I declare that the battle belongs to the Lord, and no weapon forged against me shall prosper. I resolve to stand courageous and fearless, knowing You are fighting on my behalf.",
  25: "Lord of the Stars, You count the myriad stars and call each one by name. If You know every star in the vast cosmos, how much more do You know, value, and care for me! I rest securely in Your personal love and resolve to shine brightly as Your witness today.",
  26: "God of Hope, You fill my heart with all joy and peace in believing, causing hope to abound by the Holy Spirit. I renounce all despair and discouragement, choosing instead to fix my eyes on Your glorious promises. I resolve to radiate joyful optimism and contagious faith to everyone around me.",
  27: "Lord, You are my Sun to illuminate my journey and my Shield to protect me from every spiritual assault. I declare that You will withhold no good thing from those who walk uprightly in Your ways. I resolve to walk in the brightness of Your righteousness and rely on Your defense.",
  28: "Lord Jesus, You are the Author and Finisher of my faith, who endured the cross for the joy set before You. I lay aside every weight and the sin that so easily ensnares, running my race with endurance. I keep my eyes firmly fixed on You, trusting You to bring my faith to full maturity.",
  29: "Lord of Victory, You give us the ultimate triumph over sin, death, and darkness through our Lord Jesus Christ. I confess that I am more than a conqueror through Him who loved me and gave Himself for me. I resolve to walk in victory today, refusing to succumb to fear or defeat.",
  30: "Resurrected Lord, You are the Resurrection and the Life, having broken the power of the grave forever. I declare that the same Spirit who raised Jesus from the dead dwells in me, giving divine life to my mortal body. I resolve to live with eternal purpose, confident in the promise of everlasting life.",
  31: "Prince of Peace, You have broken down every dividing wall and given me reconcilation with God. In the midst of turmoil and confusion, I receive the deep stillness and tranquility that only You can impart. I resolve to be a peacemaker today, bringing the calming presence of Christ wherever I go.",
  32: "Lord of Wisdom, You generously give wisdom and discernment to all who ask in faith without reproach. I confess my need for divine insight in every decision, relationship, and responsibility today. I resolve to seek Your heavenly wisdom above all worldly understanding.",
  33: "God of Knowledge, You understand the deepest motives of my heart and test every thought with perfect righteousness. I open my innermost being to Your refining search, asking You to cleanse any wayward way in me. I resolve to act with integrity, knowing that all things are naked and open before Your eyes.",
  34: "Wise and Mighty God, wisdom and power belong to You alone, and You reveal deep and secret things. I humble myself before Your infinite intelligence, acknowledging that my human wisdom is foolishness without You. I trust Your perfect timing and counsel in every area of my life.",
  35: "Lord, Your understanding is infinite and unsearchable by human standards. When life seems perplexing, I rest in the truth that You see the end from the beginning and make all things work together for good. I resolve to lean not on my own understanding, but to acknowledge You in all my ways.",
  36: "Lord of Counsel, You confirm the word of Your servants and bring to pass every godly purpose. I lay down my self-reliance and ask You to direct every plan and project I undertake today. I resolve to seek Your counsel in prayer before making decisions, trusting You to establish my steps.",
  37: "Lord Jesus, because You suffered being tempted, You are able to come to my aid when I am tested. I run to You the moment temptation strikes, receiving Your grace and strength to stand firm in holiness. I resolve to keep my gaze fixed upon You, the victor over every snare of the enemy.",
  38: "Miracle-Working God, You turned the hard flint into a pool of living water and refreshed Your weary people in the desert. In my dry and difficult seasons, I believe You can bring unexpected provision and supernatural revival. I look to You alone as my endless fountain of life.",
  39: "Lord of Provision, You turn the flinty ground into gushing fountains of life-giving water. When resources seem depleted, I declare that Your supernatural abundance is more than enough for my family and me. I choose to give thanks in advance for the fresh streams of blessing You are releasing.",
  40: "Sovereign and Incomparable God, to whom can I liken You, or what equal can ever be found beside You? I bow in awe before Your unsearchable greatness, declaring that You alone reign supreme over heaven and earth. I commit my whole being to worship You in spirit, truth, and singular devotion.",
  41: "Holy Lord, You dwell in unapproachable light, holy and pure beyond human sight. I draw near to Your presence not in my own merit, but clothed in the precious righteousness of Christ. May the light of Your holiness expose every hidden darkness in my heart and make me pure.",
  42: "Blessed and Only Potentate, King of kings and Lord of lords, You alone possess immortality. I confess that no earthly power or authority compares to Your eternal domain. I yield the throne of my heart entirely to Your lordship, obeying Your commands with joy and reverence.",
  43: "God of Refuge, You are our refuge and strength, a very present help in trouble; therefore I will not fear. When crisis presses in, I run into the fortress of Your presence and find unshakable peace. I resolve to stand firm in faith, knowing that the Lord of hosts is with me.",
  44: "Everlasting Light, You are the sun that never goes down and the glory that illumines my darkest night. I declare that the shadow of sorrow is fleeing away because the radiance of Your face shines upon me. I resolve to walk as a child of light, reflecting Your brightness in a dark world.",
  45: "Faithful Provider, I commit my ways entirely unto You, trusting that You will bring every righteous purpose to pass. I lay down all striving and anxiety, resting in Your unfailing ability to establish my path. I resolve to wait patiently upon You, confident that You are orchestrating all things for my good.",
  46: "Creator Lord, from You and through You and to You are all things, and in You we live and have our being. I confess that my life, breath, and purpose find their origin and meaning exclusively in Christ Jesus. I resolve to dedicate every skill, resource, and heartbeat to honor the One who created me.",
  47: "Lord Jesus, there is salvation in no other name under heaven given among men by which we must be saved. I boldly profess faith in the name of Jesus as my only Redeemer, Deliverer, and Lord. I resolve to unashamedly share the saving message of Your cross and resurrection with those around me.",
  48: "Lord Jesus, You are the glorious Head of the Church, the firstborn from the dead who holds first place in all things. I submit my life under Your supreme headship and divine authority in the body of Christ. I resolve to honor Your church, loving my brothers and sisters in genuine fellowship and unity.",
  49: "Lord, I choose to seek You with my whole heart and diligently keep Your righteous testimonies. I confess that true happiness and blessedness are found only in walking in undivided obedience to Your Word. I resolve to pursue Your presence above all earthly riches and temporal pleasures.",
  50: "God of Hidden Riches, You promise to give me the treasures of darkness and hidden wealth in secret places. In seasons of uncertainty and trial, I trust that You are forging invaluable spiritual depth and revelation within me. I resolve to seek Your presence in the quiet secret place, expecting to discover Your divine wisdom.",
  51: "Gracious Lord, there is no want to those who reverently fear and honor Your holy name. I reject the spirit of poverty and scarcity, declaring that my God will supply all my needs according to His riches in glory. I resolve to walk in holy reverence before You, knowing Your provision will never fail.",
  52: "Eternal King, You are the living God whose kingdom shall never be destroyed and whose dominion endures forever. In a world of falling empires and shifting powers, my soul rests securely in Your everlasting government. I pledge my ultimate allegiance to King Jesus and His righteous kingdom.",
  53: "Sovereign Lord, Your majesty and dominion shall endure to the very end of time. I bow before Your unmatched greatness, knowing that human pride and worldly power will soon fade away. I resolve to live for eternity, investing my life in what will outlast the world.",
  54: "All-Knowing God, great is our Lord and mighty in power; Your understanding is completely infinite. When questions linger and future steps seem unclear, I place my limited understanding into Your infinite wisdom. I resolve to trust Your perfect knowledge, knowing You never make a mistake.",
  55: "Compassionate Father, Your mercies are exceedingly great, and I gladly cast myself into Your loving hands. I admit my absolute dependency upon Your grace and rejoice that Your compassion never comes to an end. I resolve to show generous mercy to others, just as You have shown lavish mercy to me.",
  56: "Mighty in Battle, You are the King of glory, strong and victorious over every power of darkness. I invite Your glorious presence to arise and scatter every enemy of fear, sickness, and discouragement in my life. I resolve to lift up my head and welcome the King of glory to take complete control.",
  57: "Holy Father, You inhabit eternity and dwell in the high and holy place, yet You revive the humble and contrite heart. I humble myself in Your holy presence, asking You to revive my spirit and restore my first love for You. I resolve to maintain a tender and repentant heart before You each day.",
  58: "Righteous Lord, You love righteousness and justice, and the earth is full of the steadfast love of the Lord. I confess that Your standard of truth is my guide in every decision, business dealing, and conversation. I resolve to pursue biblical righteousness and champion justice for the vulnerable.",
  59: "Lord of Mercy, You do not treat us as our sins deserve, nor repay us according to our iniquities. As far as the east is from the west, so far have You removed my transgressions through the blood of Jesus. I receive Your total forgiveness and resolve to walk free from shame and guilt.",
  60: "Faithful Father, as high as the heavens are above the earth, so great is Your steadfast love toward those who fear You. When I am tempted to doubt my worth, I anchor my soul in the immeasurable height and depth of Your love. I resolve to rest securely in Your unconditional grace today.",
  61: "Father of Compassion, as a father pities his children, so the Lord shows tender compassion to those who fear Him. You know my frame and remember that I am dust, yet You embrace me with everlasting kindness. I rest in the tenderness of Your fatherly love and cast all my burdens at Your feet.",
  62: "God of Covenant, the steadfast love of the Lord is from everlasting to everlasting on those who fear Him. I stand on the unbreakable covenant sealed by the precious blood of Jesus, which secures my future forever. I resolve to keep Your commandments and pass down the heritage of faith to the next generation.",
  63: "Sovereign King, the Lord has established His throne in heaven, and His kingdom rules over all creation. I confess that no circumstance, leader, or spiritual force can override Your ultimate plan for my life. I yield my worries to Your supreme rule, rejoicing in Your total sovereignty.",
  64: "Lord of Hosts, all Your angels excel in strength, doing Your commandments and obeying the voice of Your Word. I thank You for dispatching heavenly messengers to guard and protect my family in all our ways. I resolve to speak words aligned with Scripture, giving voice to Your Word in my home.",
  65: "God of Creation, all Your works in all places of Your dominion praise and bless Your holy name. I join the chorus of creation, dedicating my mouth, mind, and spirit to declare Your wondrous deeds. Bless the Lord, O my soul, and let everything within me praise His holy name!",
  66: "Eternal Savior, Jesus Christ is the same yesterday, today, and forever without any shadow of change. When everything around me shifts and changes, I stand immovable on the rock of Your unchanging character. I resolve to build my life upon Your timeless Word, knowing You will never fail me.",
  67: "Righteous Lord, You are righteous in all Your ways and gracious in all Your works toward mankind. Even when I cannot trace Your hand or understand Your methods, I trust the goodness of Your righteous heart. I resolve to praise You through every trial, confident that all You do is perfect and just.",
  68: "Near God, the Lord is near to all who call upon Him, to all who call upon Him in truth. I draw near to You in sincere prayer, knowing that You are listening and ready to respond with power. I resolve to cultivate an unbroken conversation of prayer with You throughout this day.",
  69: "Fulfiller of Desires, You fulfill the desire of those who fear You; You also hear their cry and save them. I align my desires with Your holy will, asking You to plant godly passions and vision in my heart. I trust that as I delight myself in You, You will grant the righteous desires of my soul.",
  70: "Preserver of Souls, the Lord preserves all who love Him, but the wicked He will bring to destruction. I declare my wholehearted love for You, Lord, and rest under the safe protection of Your wings. I resolve to walk in wholehearted obedience, confident in Your divine preservation over my life.",
  71: "Unsearchable Lord, great is the Lord and greatly to be praised; Your greatness is unsearchable by human mind. I bow before Your unfathomable wisdom and majesty, acknowledging that words cannot fully capture Your glory. I commit my life to proclaim Your wondrous works and celebrate Your fame.",
  72: "Abundant Giver, the eyes of all look expectantly to You, and You give them their food in due season. I confess that You are the true source of all my provision, health, and daily bread. I resolve to thank You before every meal and trust You for every future need with complete peace.",
  73: "Generous Provider, You open Your hand and satisfy the desire of every living thing upon the earth. I renounce all greed, hoarding, and fear of lack, knowing Your open hand provides more than enough. I resolve to live with open hands toward others, sharing Your blessings with joyful generosity.",
  74: "Lifter of the Fallen, the Lord upholds all who fall and raises up all who are bowed down with heavy burdens. If I have stumbled or felt crushed by life's weights, I reach out for Your strong hand to lift me up. I declare that I will rise again in Your strength and encourage someone else who is downcast.",
  75: "Spirit of Might, strengthen me with supernatural power in my inner man according to the riches of Your glory. When my flesh is weak, I receive Your divine endurance, courage, and faith to overcome every challenge. I resolve to walk by the Spirit and live victoriously in Christ Jesus.",
  76: "God of Deliverance, You hear the cry of the humble and save them out of all their distresses. When difficulties surround me, I lift my voice in faith, knowing that my Redeemer is mighty to save. I will testify of Your supernatural deliverance and give You all the glory.",
  77: "Ever-Present God, where can I go from Your Spirit, or where can I flee from Your presence? Whether I ascend to the heights or walk through the valleys, I am surrounded by Your faithful presence. I resolve to live with holy reverence and comfort, knowing You are constantly beside me.",
  78: "Master Craftsman, I praise You because I am fearfully and wonderfully made by Your divine design. I reject all comparison, insecurity, and self-doubt, celebrating the unique purpose You have created me for. I resolve to honor You in my body and spirit, using my talents to glorify my Creator.",
  79: "Omniscient Father, You knew every day ordained for me before one of them ever came to be. I surrender my future plans into Your sovereign hands, trusting that Your plan for my life is good and perfect. I resolve to walk by faith and not by sight, resting in Your written blueprint for my destiny.",
  80: "Refining God, search me, O God, and know my heart; test me and know my anxious thoughts. Point out anything in me that offends You, and lead me along the path of everlasting life. I resolve to yield to the purifying work of Your Holy Spirit so that my life brings You honor.",
  81: "Holy Creator, how precious also are Your thoughts to me, O God! How great is the sum of them! I am humbled and overwhelmed that the God of the universe thinks of me with deep affection and care. I resolve to fill my mind with Your thoughts and meditate on Your Word day and night.",
  82: "Lord my Fortress, You are my shield and my refuge; I put my trust in Your protective Word. When spiritual warfare intensifies, I take up the shield of faith to extinguish all the fiery darts of the wicked one. I declare that my life is hidden with Christ in God, totally secure from harm.",
  83: "Faithful Guide, Your Word is a lamp unto my feet and a light unto my path in every season. When the road ahead seems foggy, I open the Scriptures to find clear illumination and divine direction. I resolve to govern my choices and actions solely by the light of Your living Word.",
  84: "God of Revival, revive me according to Your lovingkindness, so that I may keep the testimony of Your mouth. When spiritual dryness creeps into my soul, I ask for a fresh outpouring of the Holy Spirit to ignite my heart. I resolve to seek fresh passion for prayer and deeper intimacy with You today.",
  85: "Righteous Judge, Your testimonies are righteous forever; give me understanding and I shall live. I confess that Your commandments are truth and that obedience leads to life, peace, and blessing. I resolve to treasure Your statutes more than gold and align my convictions with Your truth.",
  86: "Anchor of Truth, the entirety of Your Word is truth, and every one of Your righteous judgments endures forever. I reject the shifting cultural opinions of this world and build my life upon the bedrock of Your eternal truth. I resolve to speak and defend biblical truth with love, grace, and courage.",
  87: "Prince of Peace, great peace have those who love Your law, and nothing causes them to stumble. I guard my heart against offense and anxiety by immersing myself in the love of Your holy Word. I declare that the peace of God guards my heart and mind against every attack of the enemy.",
  88: "Lord of Salvation, I rejoice at Your Word as one who finds great treasure and immense spoil. I open the Bible with eager expectation, expecting to receive divine wisdom and life-transforming revelation. I resolve to feast on Your promises daily, knowing they are sweeter than honey to my soul.",
  89: "Righteous Advocate, plead my cause and redeem me; revive me according to Your holy Word. When false accusations or impossible dilemmas arise, I trust Jesus as my righteous advocate before the Father. I resolve to be still in Your presence, knowing You will plead my cause and give me victory.",
  90: "Rock of Ages, You are my rock, my fortress, and my deliverer; my God in whom I will trust. When storms of adversity beat against my life, I stand immovable because my foundation is built upon Jesus. I declare that no earthquake of circumstance can shatter the life anchored in You.",
  91: "Lord of Glory, the heavens declare the glory of God, and the firmament shows His handiwork day and night. When I look up at the majesty of creation, I am reminded of Your infinite power and artistic perfection. I resolve to bring glory to Your name through my work, attitudes, and worship today.",
  92: "Perfect Lawgiver, the law of the Lord is perfect, converting the soul; the testimony of the Lord is sure, making wise the simple. I submit my thoughts and opinions to the transformative authority of Scripture. I resolve to allow Your Word to renew my mind and make me wise unto salvation.",
  93: "Joyful Word, the statutes of the Lord are right, rejoicing the heart; the commandment of the Lord is pure, enlightening the eyes. I confess that true, lasting joy is found in following Your righteous pathways and obeying Your precepts. I resolve to approach Your Word with delight, receiving light and spiritual clarity for my soul.",
  94: "Clean and Holy God, the fear of the Lord is clean, enduring forever; the judgments of the Lord are true and righteous altogether. I ask for a holy reverence and healthy fear of God to guard my eyes, tongue, and heart from evil. I resolve to honor You in private as well as in public, walking in clean integrity.",
  95: "Sweeter than Honey, Your Word is more to be desired than gold, yea, than much fine gold; sweeter also than honey and the honeycomb. I confess that worldly riches cannot satisfy the deep longing of my soul like Your truth does. I resolve to hunger and thirst for Your righteousness and savor Your presence every day.",
  96: "Cleansing God, cleanse me from secret faults, and keep back Your servant from presumptuous sins; let them not have dominion over me. I invite Your Holy Spirit to shine into the dark corners of my heart and root out any hidden pride or compromise. I resolve to walk in uprightness, blameless and innocent of great transgression.",
  97: "Living Redeemer, let the words of my mouth and the meditation of my heart be acceptable in Your sight, O Lord, my strength and my Redeemer. I dedicate my thoughts and conversations to be wholesome, edifying, and pleasing to You throughout this day. I confess that You are the solid rock beneath my feet and my eternal Redeemer.",
  98: "Faithful Sustainer, You are He who took me out of the womb and made me trust while on my mother's breasts. From the day of my birth until now, Your hand has preserved, protected, and carried my life through every trial. I resolve to praise You continually, knowing You will never forsake me in my future.",
  99: "Lion of Judah, You are the King of kings and Lord of lords, having names written that no one knows except Yourself. I bow before Your conquering majesty, declaring that Jesus Christ is the ultimate victor over every power of darkness. I resolve to stand strong in Your victory and boldly proclaim Your kingship to the nations.",
  100: "Lord of the Two-Edged Sword, Your living Word pierces between soul and spirit, discerning the thoughts and intents of the heart. I open my heart to the sharp, loving truth of Your Word to convict, heal, correct, and direct my life. I resolve to wield the sword of the Spirit to overcome every lie of the enemy and walk in absolute truth.",
  101: "Breaker of Iron Bars, You go before me to shatter bronze gates and cut through iron bars that obstruct my path. I confess that no locked door of impossibility can withstand Your sovereign power. I step forward boldly today, trusting Your promise to open wide the treasures of deliverance for me.",
  102: "Searcher of Hearts, You have visited me in the night and tested my innermost thoughts with pure holiness. I surrender my heart to Your refining gaze, asking that no deceit or unworthy desire be found within me. I resolve that my mouth will not transgress, and my life will bring You unblemished honor.",
  103: "God of Double Blessing, You call me a prisoner of hope and promise to restore double favor for every season of trouble. I turn away from discouragement and run straight into the stronghold of Your grace. Today, I declare that my restoration has begun and that my future will overflow with Your abundance.",
  104: "Stronghold of My Life, You are good and a mighty fortress in the day of trouble, knowing intimately all who trust in You. When anxiety presses in, I retreat into the safe haven of Your unfailing goodness. I rest peacefully today, confident that no storm can overpower the fortress of my God.",
  105: "God of Israel, You dwell between the cherubim and reign as the one true God over all the kingdoms of the earth. I bow before Your holy throne in reverence, acknowledging Your absolute supremacy over all creation. I commit every battle and uncertainty into Your sovereign hands today.",
  106: "Holy One of Israel, You are my Lord, my God, and my Savior who gave everything to redeem my soul. I confess that my identity and worth are forever established in Your unfailing covenant. I resolve to walk in holy separation from worldly compromises, honoring Your holy name.",
  107: "Shepherd of Israel, You lead Your flock like sheep and shine forth Your glory upon our path. In every confusing crossroad, I incline my ear to Your guidance and follow Your gentle direction. I trust that Your rod and staff will protect me and lead me beside quiet waters today.",
  108: "Eternal Ruler, Your goings forth have been from of old, from everlasting, and You govern Your people with perfect peace. I yield my ambitions and life choices under Your sovereign kingship. I declare that Your rule in my heart brings order, righteousness, and everlasting strength.",
  109: "King of Israel and Son of God, I confess with joy that Jesus Christ is Lord over all areas of my life. I bow my knee before Your majestic lordship and welcome Your reign into my home and family. I resolve to honor You as my King and live in faithful obedience to Your Word.",
  110: "Strength of Israel, You will not lie or change Your mind, for Your character is immovable and pure. I anchor my soul to the absolute reliability of Your eternal promises. I declare that even when human strength fails, the unchanging Strength of Israel will carry me through.",
  111: "Light of Israel, Your holy fire consumes every work of darkness and purifies my heart. I welcome the radiant light of Your truth to burn away every hidden fear and spiritual complacency. I resolve to walk in the brightness of Your presence, reflecting Your holiness to the world.",
  112: "Rock of Israel, You are the unshakable foundation upon which my soul stands secure. When circumstances shake around me, I find steadfast refuge in the Rock of my salvation. I resolve to build every plan and hope upon Your eternal truth, knowing I will never be moved.",
  113: "Consolation of Israel, You bring divine comfort and hope to every weary and waiting heart. When discouragement attempts to linger, I receive the deep consolation of Your Holy Spirit. I look forward with joyful expectation, knowing that the promise of the Lord will never tarry.",
  114: "Glory of Israel, You are the crown of beauty and honor upon Your redeemed people. I lay down all self-glory and pride, boasting only in the cross and resurrection of Jesus Christ. I resolve to live in such a way that my life reflects the brilliance of Your majestic glory.",
  115: "Refuge in Distress, You hear the groaning of the needy and provide a high shelter from every earthly storm. When troubles overwhelm my heart, I cry out to You and find immediate shelter under Your wings. I confess that my help comes from the Lord, the Maker of heaven and earth.",
  116: "God of Comfort, as a mother comforts her child, so You tenderly soothe my aching heart with everlasting love. I bring every sorrow, loss, and anxiety to Your compassionate presence and receive deep solace. I resolve to extend that same gentle comfort to those who are hurting around me.",
  117: "Faithful Shield, though a thousand fall at my side and ten thousand at my right hand, it shall not come near me. I confess that no destruction or plague has power over the one who dwells in the secret place of the Most High. I step forward in holy confidence, trusting Your angels to guard me in all my ways.",
  118: "God of Miracles, You speak words of divine creation and bring forth wonders that no eye has seen. I believe with all my heart that what is impossible with man is entirely possible with my God. I resolve to stand in expectant faith, watching for Your miraculous power to unfold in my life.",
  119: "Shepherd of the Flocks, You gather the lambs in Your arms and gently lead those with young. I rest in the tenderness of Your pastoral care, knowing You will never drive me beyond my strength. I resolve to follow Your voice obediently, trusting Your timing and gentle guidance.",
  120: "Fulfiller of Promises, not one word of all Your good promises has ever failed, for You watch over Your Word to perform it. I hold unswervingly to the hope I profess, knowing that He who promised is faithful. I declare with full assurance that every promise spoken over my destiny will come to pass.",
  121: "Blesser of the Faithful, You shower abundant blessings upon all who fear the Lord and walk in His righteous ways. I choose to order my steps according to Your holy commandments and delight in Your truth. I declare that Your blessing rests upon my home, my family, and the fruit of my labor.",
  122: "Sovereign Advocate, You take up my cause and contend with those who rise up against me. I lay down every desire to defend myself and rest in Your righteous vindication. I resolve to be still in Your presence, knowing that the Lord will fight for me and secure my peace.",
  123: "Defender of the Oppressed, You plead my cause and dry up the raging seas of opposition. When unjust battles arise, I commit my case into the hands of the righteous Judge. I proclaim that no adversary can stand against the power of Your outstretched arm.",
  124: "Giver of Heritage, children are a precious inheritance from the Lord and the fruit of the womb is Your reward. I dedicate my family and children into Your holy keeping, asking for Your wisdom to nurture them in faith. I declare that my household will serve the Lord and be mighty in the land.",
  125: "Fountain of True Wisdom, the fear of the Lord is wisdom, and departing from evil is true understanding. I humble my heart before Your holy majesty and choose to flee from every appearance of evil. I resolve to seek Your heavenly wisdom as the highest treasure of my soul.",
  126: "Returning King, You are coming quickly with reward in Your hand for all who keep Your Word. I guard my heart against spiritual slumber and fix my gaze on the blessed hope of Your return. I resolve to live each day with urgency, purity, and passion for Your eternal kingdom.",
  127: "Branch of Jesse, You arose out of dry ground as the righteous Rod to establish justice and life forever. I rejoice in the life-giving power of Christ that causes my dry seasons to blossom again. I resolve to abide in You, the true Vine, so that my life bears abundant fruit.",
  128: "God of Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob, Your covenant faithfulness endures through all generations as an everlasting memorial. I anchor my life to the generational blessings sealed in the blood of Jesus. I resolve to pass down the uncompromised legacy of faith to the generations to come.",
  129: "Divine Cleanser, purge me with hyssop and I shall be clean; wash me, and I shall be whiter than snow. I bring every stain of sin and guilt to the cleansing fountain of Jesus' precious blood. I resolve to walk in newness of life, rejoicing in the pristine purity of Your forgiveness.",
  130: "God of My Fathers, You see my affliction, defend my labor, and rebuke every scheme that seeks to rob my blessing. I declare that no adversary can strip away what God has prepared for my life. I praise You for Your watchful eye that preserves my inheritance and grants me victory.",
  131: "Giver of Grace, You bestow divine grace upon each of us according to the generous measure of Christ's gift. I receive the supernatural enablement of the Holy Spirit to fulfill the calling You have placed on my life. I resolve to use my spiritual gifts humbly to build up the body of Christ.",
  132: "Faithful God, You called me into intimate fellowship with Your Son Jesus Christ, and Your faithfulness will never fail. When my faith feels small, I look to Your unchanging fidelity that sustains me. I resolve to remain steadfast in daily prayer, cultivating true communion with my Lord.",
  133: "Risen Savior, You conquered the grave and live forevermore, triumphing over death and darkness. I declare that the power of Your resurrection is active in my spirit, restoring life to every dead situation. I resolve to walk boldly in the power of resurrection life today.",
  134: "Light of the World, as long as You are with us, no darkness can overtake our steps. I open my mind and heart to the illumination of Your presence and reject every shadow of confusion. I resolve to let the light of Christ shine through my deeds and words before all people.",
  135: "Savior of the World, the Father sent the Son to deliver humanity from sin and restore us into divine fellowship. I profess my gratitude for the gift of salvation and rejoice that my name is written in heaven. I resolve to be a bold witness of Your saving grace to everyone I meet.",
  136: "Life-Giving Spirit, the letter kills, but the Spirit imparts supernatural life and freedom. I move beyond dry legalism and yield to the vibrant, transformative power of the Holy Spirit within me. I declare that the Spirit of life in Christ Jesus has set me free from the law of sin and death.",
  137: "God on High, who is like the Lord our God, who dwells on high yet stoops down to lift the needy? I worship Your transcendent majesty and marvel at Your tender condescension toward me. I resolve to humble myself before You, trusting Your mighty hand to lift me up in due season.",
  138: "Mighty Rescuer, You brought me up out of a horrible pit and miry clay, setting my feet securely upon the Rock. I praise You for pulling me out of despair and establishing my daily steps in victory. I will sing a new song of praise to my God, declaring Your deliverance to many.",
  139: "Near God, the Lord is near to all who call upon Him in truth and sincerity of heart. I cast aside all pretense and approach Your throne with an honest, transparent soul. I resolve to seek Your face daily, knowing You listen intently to my every prayer.",
  140: "Satisfier of Souls, You make peace within our borders and fill us with the finest wheat of heaven. I receive Your supernatural provision and the satisfaction that comes only from Your living Word. I resolve to feast upon Your truth, knowing that in You my soul is fully nourished.",
  141: "Steadfast Lord, You teach me to rejoice in hope, remain patient in tribulation, and continue steadfastly in prayer. When trials press hard, I choose to respond with unwavering patience and constant communion with You. I resolve to let perseverance finish its work so that I may be mature and complete in Christ.",
  142: "God of Goodness, when I eat the fruit of my labor, happiness and divine favor shall surround my life. I thank You for blessing the work of my hands and establishing prosperity in my home. I resolve to honor You with my diligence and worship You with my daily vocation.",
  143: "Unconquerable Defender, no weapon formed against me shall prosper, and every tongue rising in judgment is condemned. I claim this divine heritage as a servant of the Lord and stand firm in Christ's righteousness. I declare that fear has no place in my heart because God is my eternal defense.",
  144: "Merciful Redeemer, You have blotted out my transgressions like a thick cloud and redeemed my life for Yourself. I receive Your full pardon and return to the warmth of Your loving arms without hesitation. I resolve to live as one redeemed, celebrating the freedom bought by the cross.",
  145: "Deliverer of the Faithful, You promise to surely deliver me because I have placed my trust in Your name. I declare that my life is guarded as a prized possession by the Lord Almighty. I resolve to trust You completely in every crisis, knowing that my safety is in Your hands.",
  146: "Covenant Blesser, You bless those who bless Your people and release Your favor across all families of the earth. I align my heart with Your covenant purposes and pray for the peace of Jerusalem and the nations. I resolve to be a conduit of Your blessing and love wherever I go.",
  147: "Strong Tower, the name of the Lord is a mighty fortress; the righteous run into it and are entirely safe. In moments of panic or temptation, I call upon the name of Jesus and find instant refuge. I resolve to anchor my security in Your name above all earthly systems.",
  148: "Gentle King, You have given me the shield of Your salvation, and Your gentleness has made me great. I marvel that Your tender love lifts me up from weakness and clothes me with honor. I resolve to treat others with the same gentleness and humility that You have shown to me.",
  149: "God of Great Mercy, great is Your mercy toward me, delivering my soul from the lowest depths. I confess my unworthiness and magnify the riches of Your redeeming grace that rescued me from destruction. I will praise You with my whole heart and tell of Your wondrous works forever.",
  150: "Faithful Father, Your compassions are new every single morning; great is Your faithfulness! I greet this day with fresh thanksgiving, knowing Your mercies will never run dry. I resolve to trust Your unchanging faithfulness through every circumstance I encounter.",
  151: "Gracious Redeemer, You crown my life with lovingkindness and tender mercies from day to day. I reject feelings of condemnation and receive the royal crown of Your unconditional love. I resolve to walk with dignity as a child of the King, glorifying You in all my actions.",
  152: "Restorer of Strength, You satisfy my mouth with good things, so that my youth is renewed like the eagle's. I receive Your supernatural revitalization into my body, mind, and spirit today. I declare that weariness is broken and that I will soar in strength on the wings of faith.",
  153: "Holy King, You make known Your righteous ways and perform wondrous acts for Your people. I open my heart to understand the wisdom of Your ways and follow the blueprint of Your Word. I resolve to declare Your mighty deeds to the next generation with joyful praise.",
  154: "Loving Father, You do not always chide, nor will You keep Your anger forever against Your children. I thank You for Your patient endurance and forgiving heart that embraces me when I return to You. I resolve to drop all grudges and extend quick forgiveness to those who offend me.",
  155: "Father of Compassion, You know our frame and remember that we are dust, yet You lavish us with eternal love. When my human fragility shows, I find comfort in Your tender, fatherly understanding. I rest in Your grace, knowing You sustain me by Your everlasting arms.",
  156: "Eternal Sovereign, from everlasting to everlasting, the mercy of the Lord is on those who fear Him. I place my family and future into the enduring covenant of Your steadfast love. I resolve to teach my children to honor Your commandments and walk in Your truth.",
  157: "King of the Heavens, the Lord has established His throne in the heavens, and His sovereignty rules over all. I confess that no earthly ruler or circumstance has power beyond what my Father permits. I rest in the perfect peace of knowing my God sits upon the throne.",
  158: "Lord of Heavenly Hosts, all Your angels excel in strength, eagerly obeying the voice of Your Word. I thank You for the ministering angels assigned to protect and guide my steps. I resolve to speak words of Scripture that align with Your will, releasing heavenly peace around me.",
  159: "Fountain of Praise, let all creation in all places of His dominion bless and magnify the Lord. I join my voice with the hosts of heaven to give You glory, honor, and heartfelt adoration. Bless the Lord, O my soul, and let all that is within me praise His holy name!",
  160: "Shepherd and Guardian, You are the Shepherd and Bishop of our souls who watches over us without slumber. I yield my restless thoughts to Your watchful care, trusting You to guard my steps and preserve my soul. I resolve to rest securely in Your unfailing vigilance tonight.",
  161: "Lord of Lovingkindness, the Lord will command His lovingkindness in the daytime, and in the night His song shall be with me. I start my morning expecting Your supernatural favor and end my evening with songs of praise. I declare that my life is enveloped in Your divine rhythm of grace and protection.",
  162: "God of My Life, You are the rock of my salvation and the very source of my breath and existence. When questions press upon my soul, I direct my prayers to You, the living God. I resolve to seek Your face continually, finding my purpose and identity in You alone.",
  163: "God of Deliverance, send out Your light and Your truth, and let them lead me to Your holy hill. When shadows of deceit and confusion try to mislead me, I cling to the guiding light of Your Word. I resolve to follow Your truth wherever it leads, finding joyful worship in Your presence.",
  164: "Exceeding Joy, I will go to the altar of God, to God my exceeding and everlasting joy. I declare that worldly pleasures cannot compare to the pure delight of being in Your presence. I resolve to praise You upon the harp of my heart and celebrate Your goodness every day.",
  165: "Hope of My Soul, why are you cast down, O my soul? Hope in God, for I shall yet praise Him, the help of my countenance and my God. I speak faith over my discouraged emotions and anchor my soul in the living God. I resolve to maintain a praise-filled countenance, knowing victory is already mine.",
  166: "Mighty Conqueror, not by their own sword did they possess the land, but by Your right hand, Your arm, and the light of Your countenance. I confess that every spiritual victory and breakthrough comes solely through Your favor and power. I lay down all self-boasting and give all credit and glory to my Redeemer.",
  167: "Rock of My Heart, my flesh and my heart may fail, but God is the strength of my heart and my portion forever. When human endurance runs low, I draw from the inexhaustible reservoir of Your divine strength. I declare that having You as my portion is greater than all earthly wealth.",
  168: "Good God, it is good for me to draw near to God; I have put my trust in the Lord God, that I may declare all Your works. I prioritize daily intimacy with You above all busy activities and distractions. I resolve to tell others of Your wondrous faithfulness and mighty deeds.",
  169: "Defender of the Downtrodden, let not the oppressed return ashamed; let the poor and needy praise Your name. I lift the cries of the suffering and brokenhearted before Your throne of justice. I declare that You will arise, plead Your cause, and turn their sorrow into joyful praise.",
  170: "Rock of Salvation, when I said, 'My foot is slipping,' Your mercy, O Lord, held me up. I confess that Your lovingkindness catches me whenever I stumble and prevents me from falling. I resolve to walk boldly in faith, knowing Your hand is holding me tight.",
  171: "Comforter of Anxious Minds, in the multitude of my anxieties within me, Your comforts delight my soul. When racing thoughts and worries crowd my mind, I welcome the soothing peace of Your presence. I resolve to meditate on Your promises, allowing Your divine joy to replace every fear.",
  172: "Fullness of Joy, in Your presence is fullness of joy; at Your right hand are pleasures forevermore. I turn away from empty worldly entertainment to find true and lasting satisfaction in Your presence. I resolve to walk along the path of life, rejoicing in the eternal pleasures of knowing You.",
  173: "Lord of Peaceful Dwellings, You promise that my tent shall be in peace and that I shall visit my home and find nothing missing. I plead the blood of Jesus over my household and family, declaring divine protection and tranquility. I resolve to foster harmony, love, and godly order within my home.",
  174: "Shield of Salvation, You have given me the shield of Your salvation; Your right hand has held me up, and Your gentleness has made me great. I hold high the shield of faith to extinguish every fiery dart of doubt and fear. I declare that I stand victorious today through the strength of Your right hand.",
  175: "Exalter of the Humble, You are the glory of our strength, and in Your divine favor our horn is exalted. I acknowledge that every elevation and blessing in my life is a gift of Your sovereign grace. I resolve to remain humble before You, giving You all the praise for every door You open.",
  176: "God of Ancient Mercies, remember, O Lord, Your tender mercies and lovingkindnesses, for they have been of old. I anchor my present needs in the rich history of Your faithfulness toward Your people. I resolve to recall Your past wonders and rest confident in Your everlasting love.",
  177: "Delight in the Word, I long for Your salvation, O Lord, and Your law is my deepest delight. I set my heart to love the Holy Scriptures and apply their truths to every part of my daily life. I resolve to meditate on Your Word, finding joy and spiritual nourishment for my soul.",
  178: "Giver of Unshakable Peace, great peace have those who love Your law, and nothing causes them to stumble. I immerse my mind in the truths of Scripture, guarding my heart against offense and bitterness. I declare that the peace of God keeps my steps steady and upright through every trial.",
  179: "Lamp unto My Feet, Your Word is a lamp to my feet, giving me clear direction for each step I take today. In moments of uncertainty, I open the Bible to receive divine illumination and clarity. I resolve to follow the guidance of Your Word and avoid the crooked paths of compromise.",
  180: "Light unto My Path, Your Word is a bright light to my path, illuminating the journey ahead with hope and purpose. I reject the darkness of worldly wisdom and walk in the radiant guidance of biblical truth. I resolve to let Your Word govern my decisions, plans, and aspirations.",
  181: "Reviving Word, this is my comfort in my affliction, for Your promise has given me life and revived my spirit. When grief or hardship weighs heavy, I find supernatural revitalization in Your living promises. I resolve to speak Your promises aloud, knowing they carry resurrection power.",
  182: "Living Spring of Water, You command the spiritual wells within me to spring up with living, refreshing water. I open my heart to the abundant outpouring of the Holy Spirit, receiving fresh joy and vigor. I resolve to sing praises to the Lord, watching fresh rivers of grace flow through my life.",
  183: "Divider of Rivers, You broke open fountains and dried up mighty rushing rivers before Your people. I believe that no obstacle of circumstance or impossible flood can stop the purposes of God in my life. I step forward in faith, trusting You to make a way where there seems to be no way.",
  184: "Fragrant Savior, Your name is like ointment poured forth, filling the atmosphere with divine sweetness and grace. I dedicate my life to be a sweet aroma of Christ, spreading the knowledge of Him everywhere I go. I resolve to keep my heart pure and deeply in love with my Savior.",
  185: "Eternal Wisdom, You were brought forth before the ancient depths and fountains were formed. I humble my intellect before Your preeminent wisdom, seeking Your mind in all my endeavors. I resolve to align my plans with Your eternal counsel, which stands secure forever.",
  186: "Refining Fire, You make Your angels spirits and Your ministers a flaming fire of holy zeal. I pray for a fresh baptism of the Holy Spirit to ignite my heart with holy passion and purity. I resolve to serve You with burning devotion, unashamed of the gospel of Jesus Christ.",
  187: "Compassionate Master, the Lord will judge His people and have tender compassion on His faithful servants. When I face misunderstandings or harsh criticism, I rest in Your loving vindication. I resolve to serve You wholeheartedly, knowing that my Master is gentle, kind, and just.",
  188: "Prosperer of Servants, let the Lord be magnified, who takes great pleasure in the prosperity and well-being of His servant. I receive Your favor, health, and peace, knowing that You desire the best for my life. I resolve to use every blessing and resource to advance Your kingdom and help others.",
  189: "Confirmer of Words, You confirm the word of Your servants and perform the counsel of Your messengers. I resolve to speak words of faith, hope, and Scripture, aligning my tongue with Your divine will. I trust that every godly decree and prayer spoken in faith will be established by Your hand.",
  190: "Giver of Heartfelt Joy, Your servants shall sing for joy of heart because of the abundance of Your grace. I reject gloom, complaining, and bitterness, choosing instead to put on the garment of praise. I resolve to fill my home and workplace with songs of thanksgiving and joy.",
  191: "Revealer of Secrets, You do nothing without revealing Your secret counsel to Your servants the prophets. I quiet my soul to listen to the whisper of Your Holy Spirit through the Scriptures. I resolve to walk in spiritual discernment and align my life with Your prophetic purposes.",
  192: "El Shaddai, Almighty and All-Sufficient God, You appear to us and call us to walk blameless before You. I confess that You are more than enough to fulfill every need, promise, and destiny in my life. I resolve to walk in integrity, relying solely upon Your limitless grace and power.",
  193: "God of Elijah, You answer by fire and divide the raging waters before those who call upon Your name. I ask for the mantle of bold faith to confront the impossibilities and spiritual dry spells of our day. I resolve to stand courageous for truth, knowing that the God of miracles is with me.",
  194: "Holy and Jealous God, You are a jealous God who desires my undivided love, devotion, and worship. I tear down every modern idol of pride, materialism, and distraction that competes with You. I resolve to love the Lord my God with all my heart, soul, mind, and strength.",
  195: "Supreme God, I know that the Lord is great, and our God is exalted above all gods and earthly powers. I bow before Your unmatched supremacy, declaring that no idol or ideology can compare to Jesus. I commit my life to worship You alone with sincere and uncompromised devotion.",
  196: "One Heavenly Father, have we not all one Father? Has not one God created every one of us? I thank You for making me part of Your global family through the redeeming blood of Jesus. I resolve to walk in unity, love, and mutual respect with all my brothers and sisters in Christ.",
  197: "Fullness of All, Christ is the Head of the Church, the fullness of Him who fills all in all. I open every compartment of my spirit, mind, and home to be filled with the presence of Jesus. I resolve to live as an active, honoring member of the body of Christ today.",
  198: "Father and Creator, You bought me with a price, formed me in the womb, and established my life. I confess that I belong entirely to You, not to myself or to the patterns of this world. I resolve to honor my Creator with my body, my thoughts, and every breath I breathe.",
  199: "Redeeming Father, You took possession of my soul, delivered me from darkness, and made me Your child. I rejoice that I am no longer an orphan in this world, but deeply cherished and secure in Your family. I resolve to live as a grateful son and heir of Your eternal kingdom.",
  200: "El Roi, the God Who Sees Me, You look upon me with tender love and know every detail of my path. Even in hidden seasons and lonely places, I am never forgotten or abandoned by my God. I resolve to walk in the comfort and accountability of knowing that Your eyes are always upon me.",
  201: "God of My Praise, do not remain silent, O God of my praise, but arise and defend my life. When false accusations or cruel words rise against me, I entrust my reputation into Your hands. I resolve to keep my heart free from bitterness and continue praising You with unceasing joy.",
  202: "Deliverer from Slander, deliver my soul, O Lord, from lying lips and from a deceitful tongue. I ask You to guard my ears from gossip and preserve my heart from harmful words. I resolve to speak only what is true, edifying, and full of grace to everyone I encounter.",
  203: "Shield from Arrow and Plague, You deliver me from the snare of the fowler and from the perilous pestilence. I declare that no weapon formed against me shall prosper under the shadow of Your wings. I resolve to live in confident peace, refusing to be paralyzed by the fears of this world.",
  204: "Guardian of My Sleep, He who keeps you will not slumber; the Keeper of Israel neither slumbers nor sleeps. I lay down my head tonight in perfect peace, knowing that my God is watching over my household. I cast all my anxieties on You, resting in Your nonstop vigilance.",
  205: "Preserver of My Life, the Lord shall preserve you from all evil; He shall preserve your soul. I declare that my going out and coming in are covered by Your divine hedge of protection now and forever. I resolve to walk courageously into every duty, confident of Your preserving grace.",
  206: "Lifter of the Bowed Down, the Lord upholds all who fall and raises up all who are bowed down with heavy loads. When exhaustion or failure weighs heavily on my shoulders, I reach for Your strong and gracious hand. I declare that I will stand tall again through the supernatural strength of Christ.",
  207: "Healer of Broken Hearts, He heals the brokenhearted and binds up all their painful wounds. I bring every sorrow, rejection, and trauma to the gentle, restorative touch of Jesus. I receive Your healing balm today and resolve to let Your love make me whole and fruitful again.",
  208: "Sovereign of the Stars, You determine the number of the stars and call each one by name. If the vast galaxies are under Your precise command, I know You have not forgotten a single detail of my life. I resolve to rest in Your great power and trust Your loving plan for my future.",
  209: "Upholder of the Humble, the Lord lifts up the humble and casts the wicked down to the ground. I choose the path of humility, meekness, and teachability before Your holy Word. I trust You to lift me up in Your perfect timing, giving You all the glory for every elevation.",
  210: "Giver of Joyful Songs, sing to the Lord with thanksgiving; sing praises on the harp to our God. I determine to make thanksgiving the prevailing rhythm of my thoughts and conversations. I resolve to worship You not just when circumstances are easy, but in all things and at all times.",
  211: "Lord of the Heavens, You cover the heavens with clouds, prepare rain for the earth, and make grass grow on the mountains. I marvel at Your continuous, faithful care for all of creation and trust You for my daily needs. I resolve to praise You as the generous Provider who never neglects His children.",
  212: "Provider of All Creatures, You give food to the beasts and feed the young ravens when they cry. If You feed the wild birds, how much more will You care for me, Your redeemed child! I lay down all worry about tomorrow, confident in Your abundant and timely provision.",
  213: "Pleasure in the God-Fearing, the Lord takes pleasure in those who fear Him, in those who hope in His steadfast love. I set my heart to honor You with deep reverence and anchor my expectation in Your unfailing mercy. I resolve to live as one who brings a smile to the Father's heart today.",
  214: "Fortifier of Gates, You strengthen the bars of our gates and bless our children within our homes. I welcome Your divine protection over my family, property, and community against all harm. I resolve to dedicate my home to be a sanctuary of prayer, peace, and righteous living.",
  215: "Peacemaker of Borders, You establish peace within our borders and satisfy us with the finest of wheat. I declare that strife, division, and turmoil are banished from my home and relationships. I resolve to walk as a peacemaker, feasting upon the rich and nourishing bread of Your Word.",
  216: "Dispatcher of Swift Decrees, You send out Your command to the earth, and Your Word runs very swiftly. I declare that Your living Word is actively working to accomplish Your purpose in my life. I align my prayers with Scripture, confident that Your Word never returns void.",
  217: "Master of Seasons, You give snow like wool, scatter frost like ashes, and cast forth hail like morsels. I acknowledge that every season of my life—winter and summer, trial and triumph—is under Your sovereign control. I resolve to trust Your perfect timing, knowing You make all things beautiful in their time.",
  218: "Melter of Cold Winds, You send out Your Word and melt the ice; You cause Your wind to blow, and the waters flow. In every frozen, stagnant area of my life, I invite the warm breath of Your Holy Spirit to bring fresh revival. I declare that breakthrough and flowing streams of blessing are released today.",
  219: "Revealer of Divine Statutes, You declare Your Word to Jacob, Your statutes and judgments to Israel. I thank You for the incredible privilege of possessing and understanding the Holy Scriptures. I resolve to study, obey, and treasure Your righteous statutes above all earthly knowledge.",
  220: "Covenant of Singular Favor, You have not dealt thus with any other nation, revealing Your holy laws to us. I praise You for bringing me into the new covenant sealed with the precious blood of Christ. I resolve to live in holy devotion as a member of Your royal priesthood and chosen people.",
  221: "Exalted King of Creation, let heaven and earth praise the name of the Lord, for His name alone is exalted. I lift Your glorious name above every earthly title, reputation, and worldly ambition. I commit my mouth and heart to declare Your unmatched praise throughout all the earth.",
  222: "Horn of Salvation, You have exalted the horn of Your people, the praise of all Your saints. I confess that my strength and dignity are restored through the triumphant victory of Jesus Christ. I resolve to walk with holy courage, rejoicing in the salvation You have given me.",
  223: "Delight of Zion, the Lord takes pleasure in His people and beautifies the humble with salvation. I embrace the beauty of holiness and the garment of salvation that You have placed upon me. I resolve to walk humbly with my God, reflecting Your grace, kindness, and love to others.",
  224: "Maintainer of the Afflicted, I know that the Lord will maintain the cause of the afflicted and execute justice for the poor. When vulnerable people suffer, I trust that You see their tears and will arise in righteous judgment. I resolve to be a voice of justice, defending the oppressed and sharing my resources.",
  225: "Lifter from Affliction, You set the needy on high, far from affliction, and make their families flourish like a flock. I thank You for lifting me out of poverty of spirit and blessing my household with abundant peace. I resolve to walk in gratitude, testifying of Your goodness to everyone around me.",
  226: "Promoter of the Humble, You raise the poor out of the dust and seat them with princes of Your people. I acknowledge that every honor and promotion in my life comes from Your gracious hand alone. I resolve to remain humble in success, using every platform to glorify Jesus Christ.",
  227: "True Light of the World, That was the true Light which gives light to every person coming into the world. I open every corner of my soul to the brilliant light of Jesus, banishing all darkness and confusion. I resolve to let the radiance of Christ shine through my deeds so that others may see and glorify God.",
  228: "Overcomer of Strongholds, by faith the walls of Jericho fell down flat after they were encircled for seven days. I shout praises of victory over every spiritual wall and obstacle standing before my destiny. I declare that by faith in the mighty name of Jesus, every stronghold of the enemy is crumbling.",
  229: "Worker of Countless Wonders, You do great things past finding out, yes, wonders without number. I expand my expectations and refuse to limit the supernatural power of my Almighty God. I resolve to live in daily wonder and gratitude, watching for Your miraculous hand in my life.",
  230: "Performer of My Destiny, You perform what is appointed for me, and many such glorious things are with You. I rest in the truth that my days were written in Your book before one of them came to be. I surrender my plans to Your sovereign blueprint, confident that You will fulfill my purpose.",
  231: "Performer of All Things, I will cry out to God Most High, to God who performs all things for me. I lay down all striving and self-effort, trusting my Heavenly Father to bring His good work to completion. I declare that the Lord will perfect that which concerns me, for His mercy endures forever.",
  232: "Restorer of the Broken, You seek the lost, bring back the scattered, bind up the broken, and strengthen the weak. I place my weaknesses and scars into the gentle hands of the Great Physician. I receive Your healing strength today and resolve to comfort others with the comfort I have received.",
  233: "God of All-Abounding Grace, God is able to make all grace abound toward you, that you always have all sufficiency for every good work. I reject the spirit of lack and receive the lavish overflow of Your supernatural provision. I resolve to be a cheerful giver and a channel of blessing to every good work.",
  234: "Welcoming Savior, anyone who comes to Me I will by no means cast out, says the Lord. I come boldly to Jesus with all my burdens, confident in His open arms of unconditional love. I resolve to welcome and extend grace to others, just as Christ has welcomed me to the glory of God.",
  235: "Author of Salvation, whom He predestined, these He also called, justified, and glorified in Christ. I praise You for choosing me in Christ before the foundation of the world and securing my eternal future. I resolve to walk worthy of the high calling of God, living in holiness and righteousness.",
  236: "Only Potentate, King of kings and Lord of lords, You alone possess immortality and reign in unapproachable light. I bow in worship before Your majestic sovereignty and yield all control of my life to Your lordship. I resolve to live for the eternal kingdom that will never pass away.",
  237: "Strength to the Needy, You have been a strength to the poor in distress, a refuge from the storm, and shade from the heat. When scorching pressures beat upon my life, I hide beneath the protective shelter of Your grace. I declare that no heat of affliction can harm me because God is my shade.",
  238: "Hearer of the Poor Man's Cry, this poor man cried out, and the Lord heard him and saved him out of all his troubles. I lift my sincere prayer to You, knowing that You never despise the cry of the humble. I will testify of Your deliverance and encourage others to trust in Your saving name.",
  239: "Judge of the Fatherless, defend the poor and fatherless; do justice to the afflicted and needy. I align my heart with Your passion for the vulnerable, the orphan, and the widow. I resolve to practice pure and undefiled religion by showing active compassion and generosity to those in need.",
  240: "Sender of Showers of Blessing, I will cause showers to come down in their season; there shall be showers of blessing! I prepare my heart in faith for the outpouring of Your supernatural favor and revival. I declare that every dry season in my life is giving way to refreshing rain from heaven.",
  241: "Lord of the Golden Lampstands, You walk in the midst of the seven lampstands, watching over Your Church with holy eyes. I welcome Your presence into my local church and into my personal walk of faith. I resolve to keep my spiritual lamp burning brightly with the pure oil of the Holy Spirit.",
  242: "Holder of the Seven Stars, You hold the leaders and messengers of the church securely in Your right hand. I pray for Your protection, wisdom, and anointing upon our spiritual shepherds and pastors. I resolve to honor and support godly leadership, keeping myself firmly in Your hand.",
  243: "Giver of Words in Season, a word spoken in due season, how good and pleasant it is! I ask for the tongue of the learned to speak words of life, encouragement, and hope to the weary. I resolve to let no corrupt communication proceed from my mouth, but only what imparts grace to the hearers.",
  244: "Lifter of the Humble, humble yourselves under the mighty hand of God, that He may exalt you in due time. I lay aside all pride, self-promotion, and ambition, bowing low before Your sovereign authority. I trust Your perfect timing to lift me up, giving You all the glory for every open door.",
  245: "Author of Unity, fulfill my joy by being like-minded, having the same love, being of one accord and of one mind. I guard my heart against gossip, division, and rivalry within the body of Christ. I resolve to pursue harmony, peace, and mutual love with all my brothers and sisters in faith.",
  246: "Rich Lord over All, there is no distinction, for the same Lord over all is rich to all who call upon Him. I call upon Your name with holy boldness, knowing that Your grace and resources are inexhaustible. I declare that all my needs are abundantly supplied through the riches of Christ.",
  247: "God of Glorious Supply, my God shall supply all your need according to His riches in glory by Christ Jesus. I cast off all financial fear and anxiety, resting in the covenant promises of my Heavenly Father. I resolve to honor You with my firstfruits and trust Your supernatural multiplication in my life.",
  248: "Source of Wealth and Honor, both riches and honor come from You, and You reign over all with power and might. I confess that every talent, opportunity, and possession I have is a gift from Your generous hand. I dedicate all my resources to honor Your name and advance Your kingdom.",
  249: "Possessor of True Riches, riches and honor are with Wisdom, enduring riches and righteousness. I pursue the wisdom of God above all temporary wealth, knowing it brings eternal reward and peace. I resolve to store up treasures in heaven, walking in biblical integrity and righteousness.",
  250: "Giver of Power to Get Wealth, remember the Lord your God, for it is He who gives you power to get wealth to establish His covenant. I acknowledge that my ability to create wealth and succeed comes solely from You. I commit to being a faithful steward, honoring Your covenant and blessing those in need.",
  251: "Lord of Eternal Honor, You reign over all, and in Your hand is power and might to make great and give strength. I praise You as the ultimate source of all true greatness, authority, and blessing. I resolve to use whatever influence You give me to point others to the majesty of Jesus Christ.",
  252: "God of Endless Riches, in Him we have redemption through His blood, the forgiveness of sins, according to the riches of His grace. I rejoice in the boundless wealth of Your grace that washed away my guilt and made me an heir of God. I resolve to live each day in the freedom and joy of Your lavish love.",
  253: "Father of Glorious Inheritance, I pray that the eyes of my understanding may be enlightened to know the riches of the glory of His inheritance in the saints. I open my spiritual eyes to comprehend the limitless spiritual treasures I have in Christ. I resolve to walk in victory, claiming my royal heritage as a child of God.",
  254: "Unsearchable Christ, to me was this grace given, to preach among the nations the unsearchable riches of Christ. I marvel at the boundless depth of wisdom, love, and righteousness found in Jesus alone. I resolve to share the glorious riches of the gospel with bold passion and unashamed conviction.",
  255: "Father of Great Mercy, God, who is rich in mercy, because of His great love with which He loved us, made us alive together with Christ. Even when I was dead in trespasses, Your mercy reached down and gave me eternal life. I celebrate Your lavish love today and resolve to extend that same mercy to others.",
  256: "Demonstrator of Exceeding Grace, in the ages to come He might show the exceeding riches of His grace in His kindness toward us in Christ Jesus. I am overwhelmed by the eternal destiny of glory and favor You have prepared for Your children. I resolve to live in eager expectation of the eternal blessings of heaven.",
  257: "Strengthener of the Inner Man, grant me according to the riches of Your glory to be strengthened with might through Your Spirit in the inner man. When physical strength fades, I tap into the boundless power of the Holy Spirit living within me. I declare that my spirit is strong, resilient, and victorious through Christ.",
  258: "Giver of Limitless Supply, my God shall supply all your need according to His riches in glory by Christ Jesus. I stand firm on this unbreakable promise, refusing to let fear of lack dictate my choices. I resolve to walk in generosity and faith, knowing my Father's supply never runs dry.",
  259: "Fulfiller of the Word, the word of God grew and multiplied mightily across the land. I declare that the living seed of Scripture is bearing abundant fruit in my heart, family, and community. I resolve to sow the Word of God daily through my speech, actions, and intercession.",
  260: "Teacher of Contentment, godliness with contentment is great gain, for we brought nothing into this world, and we can carry nothing out. I renounce all greed, envy, and worldly comparison, choosing to be deeply thankful for all I have. I resolve to pursue holiness and find complete satisfaction in Jesus Christ alone.",
  261: "Provider of All Things Richly, charge those who are rich not to trust in uncertain riches but in the living God, who gives us richly all things to enjoy. I place my ultimate trust in the Giver rather than in the gifts of this world. I resolve to enjoy Your blessings with thanksgiving while holding all material things with an open, generous hand.",
  262: "God of Regenerating Mercy, according to His mercy He saved us, through the washing of regeneration and renewing of the Holy Spirit. I thank You for cleansing my past and giving me a brand new life through the Spirit. I resolve to walk in daily spiritual renewal, letting Your grace transform my thoughts and desires.",
  263: "Fulfiller of Royal Decrees, the King's word has power, and what He decrees will surely come to pass. I submit my life to the royal authority of King Jesus and align my speech with His truth. I declare that the righteous promises of God are establishing peace and breakthrough in my life.",
  264: "God of Steadfast Purpose, the counsel of the Lord stands forever, the plans of His heart to all generations. In a world of fleeting human opinions, I build my life upon the bedrock of Your eternal purpose. I resolve to seek Your divine will in all things, knowing Your plan for me will never fail.",
  265: "Provider for the Needy, the poor and needy seek water, and there is none, but I the Lord will hear them; I the God of Israel will not forsake them. When I encounter spiritual or physical dryness, I run to the fountain of Your living presence. I declare with certainty that my God will never abandon me in my time of need.",
  266: "Promiser of Great Things, call to Me, and I will answer you, and show you great and mighty things, which you do not know. I lift my voice in fervent, expectant prayer, believing for supernatural revelation and guidance. I resolve to spend time in prayer each day, expecting to hear from the living God.",
  267: "God of Covenant Faithfulness, though the mountains depart and the hills be removed, My kindness shall not depart from you, nor My covenant of peace be removed. I anchor my soul in the unbreakable security of Your eternal love and peace. I declare that no storm can shake the peace that God has established over my life.",
  268: "Sovereign Healer, I will restore health to you and heal you of your wounds, says the Lord. I bring every sickness, infirmity, and emotional pain under the restorative authority of Christ's stripes. I declare that divine healing and wholeness are flowing into my body and soul today.",
  269: "Giver of Divine Favor, You surround the righteous with favor as with a shield. I step out into this day expecting doors of opportunity, wisdom, and goodwill to open before me. I resolve to walk in righteousness and give all glory to God for every blessing of favor.",
  270: "Unshakable Fortress, the Lord is my rock, my fortress, and my deliverer; my God, my strength, in whom I will trust. When enemies of fear and anxiety attack, I retreat into the fortress of Your holy presence. I declare that I am completely safe, protected, and victorious in Christ Jesus.",
  271: "Promoter of Mutual Love, let brotherly love continue, and do not forget to entertain strangers with genuine warmth. I open my heart to love my neighbors and fellow believers with the selfless love of Christ. I resolve to show hospitality and kindness to those who cross my path today.",
  272: "Giver of Pure Hearts, create in me a clean heart, O God, and renew a steadfast spirit within me. I bring my thoughts and desires to the altar of Your holiness, asking for complete purification. I resolve to guard my heart above all else, for from it flow the issues of life.",
  273: "Builder of Unity, let us not judge one another anymore, but resolve not to put a stumbling block in our brother's way. I choose to extend grace rather than criticism, building up others with patience and understanding. I resolve to walk in love, making every effort to maintain peace and edify the body of Christ.",
  274: "Guardian of Harmony, if you bite and devour one another, beware lest you be consumed by one another! I renounce all gossip, harsh words, and competitive spirits that damage Christian fellowship. I resolve to speak words of blessing, encouragement, and healing in every relationship.",
  275: "Lover of Hospitality, be hospitable to one another without grumbling or complaining. I open my home and resources with joy to serve and bless others in Jesus' name. I resolve to serve with a cheerful heart, reflecting the generous hospitality of our Heavenly Father.",
  276: "Forgiving Lord, bear with one another and forgive one another; even as Christ forgave you, so you also must do. I release all bitterness and resentment, choosing to forgive freely just as I have been lavishly forgiven. I resolve to walk in tenderhearted mercy and keep no record of wrongs.",
  277: "Author of Peace, greet one another with love; peace to all who are in Christ Jesus. I receive the shalom of God into my spirit and purpose to be a bearer of Christ's peace wherever I go. I resolve to communicate warmth, love, and respect in all my interactions today.",
  278: "Uniter of the Body, we, being many, are one body in Christ, and individually members of one another. I celebrate the diversity of gifts in the Church and embrace my vital role in the body of Christ. I resolve to support, encourage, and pray for my brothers and sisters in faith.",
  279: "Exhorter of the Saints, do not forsake assembling together, but exhort one another as you see the Day approaching. I commit myself to regular fellowship, worship, and accountability with the people of God. I resolve to encourage someone in their walk with Christ today with words of hope.",
  280: "Pattern of Forgiveness, be kind to one another, tenderhearted, forgiving one another, even as God in Christ forgave you. I ask the Holy Spirit to soften my heart with divine kindness and deep empathy for others. I resolve to model Christ's forgiveness and speak words that heal rather than hurt.",
  281: "Lord of Holy Reverence, submitting to one another in the fear of God with mutual respect and humility. I lay aside self-will and pride, choosing to honor and serve others in the fear of the Lord. I resolve to cultivate a spirit of humble cooperation in my home, workplace, and church.",
  282: "Destroyer of Envy, let us not become conceited, provoking one another, envying one another. I reject jealousy and rejoice sincerely in the successes and blessings of others. I resolve to be secure in God's unique plan for my life, celebrating the gifts He gives to my brothers and sisters.",
  283: "Guardian of Speech, do not speak evil of one another, brethren, for we are called to walk in righteousness. I place a guard over my mouth and a watch over the door of my lips by the grace of God. I resolve to speak only what builds up faith and imparts grace to those who hear.",
  284: "Reconciler of Brethren, why do you wrong one another, seeing that you are brethren in Christ? I refuse to harbor grudges or participate in strife that fractures Christian unity. I resolve to be an agent of reconciliation, pursuing peace and restoring broken relationships through love.",
  285: "Hearer of Fervent Prayer, confess your trespasses to one another, and pray for one another, that you may be healed. I choose transparency, humility, and passionate intercession for my brothers and sisters. I declare that the effective, fervent prayer of the righteous avails much and releases divine healing.",
  286: "Fountain of Kindness, be kind, tenderhearted, and quick to forgive, reflecting the heart of the Father. I invite the Holy Spirit to pour the love of God into my heart so that it overflows onto everyone around me. I resolve to practice intentional acts of kindness and show compassion to the hurting.",
  287: "Prince of Peace, have salt in yourselves, and have peace with one another at all times. I allow the salt of God's truth to purify my speech and season my relationships with grace. I resolve to live in peace with all people, letting the tranquility of Christ reign in my heart.",
  288: "Cleanser by the Blood, if we walk in the light as He is in the light, we have fellowship with one another, and the blood of Jesus cleanses us from all sin. I choose to walk in openness, truth, and genuine fellowship with God and His people. I declare that the blood of Jesus Christ continually cleanses and protects my soul.",
  289: "Lord of the Outstretched Arm, with a mighty hand and an outstretched arm You govern Your people in righteousness. I bow before Your sovereign power, knowing that You rule over all nations and personal circumstances. I resolve to surrender every area of my life under Your mighty, loving hand.",
  290: "Lord of the Sabbath, remember the Sabbath day, to keep it holy unto the Lord. I dedicate time to rest in Your presence, worship Your majesty, and refresh my soul in Your grace. I resolve to honor You with holy rhythms of rest, prayer, and undivided worship.",
  291: "Deliverer by Mighty Power, You brought Your people out of bondage by Your mighty power and outstretched arm. I praise You for shattering every chain of spiritual captivity, fear, and sin in my life. I declare that whom the Son sets free is truly free indeed, and I will walk in that freedom.",
  292: "Lord Worthy of Loud Praise, praise Him with loud cymbals; praise Him with clashing cymbals and joyful sounds! I lift my voice with exuberant thanksgiving, celebrating the greatness and triumphs of my God. I resolve to praise the Lord with all my heart, filling my environment with holy joy.",
  293: "Hosanna to the King, Hosanna! Blessed is He who comes in the name of the Lord, the King of Israel! I open wide the gates of my heart to welcome King Jesus as the absolute Lord of my life. I resolve to live for His praise and honor Him in everything I do and say.",
  294: "Divine Physician, You are the medicine that heals our incurable wounds and restores wholeness to our lives. I receive the supernatural healing virtue of Jesus into every sick, damaged, or weary part of my body and soul. I declare that by His stripes I am healed and made completely whole.",
  295: "Faithful Ambassador, a faithful ambassador brings health, peace, and life-giving wisdom. I dedicate my life to be a trustworthy representative of the kingdom of God wherever I go. I resolve to speak words of truth, healing, and hope that bring life to everyone I meet.",
  296: "Wise Tongue of Healing, the tongue of the wise promotes health and speaks words of life. I ask the Holy Spirit to govern my speech so that my words bring encouragement, wisdom, and healing. I resolve to refrain from harsh words and speak only what edifies and builds up others.",
  297: "Giver of a Merry Heart, a merry heart does good, like medicine, but a broken spirit dries the bones. I choose the joy of the Lord as my daily medicine and strength, casting off all gloom and despair. I resolve to rejoice in the Lord always and spread the infectious joy of Christ to those around me.",
  298: "Great and Exalted Lord, great is the Lord, and greatly to be praised in the city of our God, on His holy mountain. I magnify Your infinite majesty, power, and holiness above all created things. I resolve to declare Your greatness and live as a radiant citizen of Your heavenly kingdom.",
  299: "Righteous Lord, the righteous Lord loves righteousness, and His countenance beholds the upright with favor. I commit myself to pursue biblical holiness, honesty, and integrity in every private and public action. I declare that the light of Your countenance shines upon me, filling my life with peace and purpose.",
  300: "Righteous Judge of All, let the Lord be judge, and plead my case and deliver me out of every hand of adversity. I place my reputation, future, and every difficult situation into the hands of the righteous Judge. I rest in complete peace, knowing that the Lord will vindicate me and lead me into eternal victory.",
};

// Backward compatibility alias
export const PERSONAL_AFFIRMATIONS_100 = PERSONAL_AFFIRMATIONS_300;
